4:T275b,<p>Welcome to <strong>Smile Agri-Market Technologies Ltd</strong> ("Smile Agri-Market," "Company," "we," "our," or "us"). This Disclaimer applies to your access to and use of <a href="https://smileagrimarket.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><strong>https://smileagrimarket.com</strong></a>, our mobile applications, APIs, and all related services (collectively, the "Platform").</p>
<p>By accessing or using the Platform, you acknowledge that you have read, understood, and agree to this Disclaimer.</p>
<h2>1. General Information Only</h2>
<p>The information provided on the Platform is for general informational and educational purposes only.</p>
<p>While we strive to keep the information accurate, current, and useful, Smile Agri-Market makes no representation or warranty that all information is complete, accurate, reliable, suitable, or available at all times.</p>
<p>You are responsible for evaluating any information before relying on it.</p>
<h2>2. Marketplace Role</h2>
<p>Smile Agri-Market is a technology platform that connects buyers, sellers, farmers, agricultural businesses, logistics providers, consultants, financial institutions, and other stakeholders.</p>
<p>Unless expressly stated otherwise, Smile Agri-Market is <strong>not</strong>:</p>
<ul><li>The manufacturer of listed products.</li><li>The grower or producer of every product sold.</li><li>The importer or exporter of listed goods.</li><li>A warehouse operator for every transaction.</li><li>A transportation company.</li><li>A party to every sales contract between buyers and sellers.</li></ul>
<p>Sales contracts are generally formed directly between buyers and sellers. Smile Agri-Market provides the technology and related services that facilitate those transactions.</p>
<h2>3. Product Information</h2>
<p>Product descriptions, photographs, prices, specifications, and availability are primarily provided by sellers.</p>
<p>Although we encourage accuracy and may review listings, we do not guarantee that:</p>
<ul><li>Product descriptions are error-free.</li><li>Images precisely reflect the delivered product.</li><li>Products will always be available.</li><li>Prices are free from typographical errors.</li><li>Every listing complies with applicable laws at all times.</li></ul>
<p>Agricultural products naturally vary due to factors such as weather, season, soil conditions, harvest methods, and storage.</p>
<h2>4. Product Quality and Food Safety</h2>
<p>Smile Agri-Market encourages sellers to comply with applicable food safety and agricultural regulations.</p>
<p>However, unless expressly stated, we do not independently inspect, test, certify, or guarantee every product listed on the Platform.</p>
<p>Buyers are responsible for inspecting products upon delivery and reporting concerns in accordance with our Refund & Cancellation Policy.</p>
<h2>5. Agricultural Information Disclaimer</h2>
<p>The Platform may provide information relating to:</p>
<ul><li>Crop production.</li><li>Irrigation.</li><li>Pest management.</li><li>Fertilizer application.</li><li>Livestock management.</li><li>Greenhouse farming.</li><li>Climate-smart agriculture.</li><li>Agricultural best practices.</li></ul>
<p>This information is intended for general educational purposes only.</p>
<p>Agricultural outcomes depend on numerous factors, including weather, soil conditions, water availability, pests, diseases, management practices, and local regulations.</p>
<p>Smile Agri-Market does not guarantee specific farming results, crop yields, income, or profitability.</p>
<p>Users should consult qualified agricultural professionals before making significant farming decisions.</p>
<h2>6. AI Disclaimer</h2>
<p>The Platform may include artificial intelligence ("AI") features that generate recommendations, summaries, forecasts, or other content.</p>
<p>AI-generated content is provided for informational purposes only.</p>
<p>AI outputs:</p>
<ul><li>May contain errors or omissions.</li><li>May not reflect current market conditions.</li><li>Should be independently verified where appropriate.</li><li>Should not be treated as professional advice.</li></ul>
<p>Users remain responsible for decisions made using AI-generated information.</p>
<h2>7. Market Prices</h2>
<p>Commodity prices, market trends, and pricing information displayed on the Platform may change rapidly.</p>
<p>Smile Agri-Market does not guarantee that displayed prices:</p>
<ul><li>Reflect current market conditions.</li><li>Will remain available.</li><li>Represent the best available market price.</li></ul>
<p>Users should independently evaluate pricing before completing transactions.</p>
<h2>8. Investment Disclaimer</h2>
<p>The Platform may provide information about agricultural investment opportunities where permitted by applicable law.</p>
<p>Nothing on the Platform constitutes:</p>
<ul><li>Financial advice.</li><li>Investment advice.</li><li>Tax advice.</li><li>Legal advice.</li><li>A recommendation to buy or sell any security or investment product.</li><li>A guarantee of returns.</li></ul>
<p>Agricultural investments involve risks, including the possible loss of capital.</p>
<p>Users should conduct their own due diligence and seek advice from qualified financial, legal, and tax professionals before making investment decisions.</p>
<h2>9. Third-Party Services</h2>
<p>The Platform may integrate or link to third-party services, including:</p>
<ul><li>Payment processors.</li><li>Logistics providers.</li><li>Warehousing providers.</li><li>Financial institutions.</li><li>Government services.</li><li>Insurance providers.</li><li>Mapping services.</li><li>Weather information providers.</li></ul>
<p>Smile Agri-Market does not control these third-party services and is not responsible for their availability, accuracy, security, products, services, or policies.</p>
<p>Your use of third-party services is subject to their respective terms and policies.</p>
<h2>10. External Links</h2>
<p>Our Platform may contain links to external websites for your convenience.</p>
<p>These links do not constitute an endorsement, sponsorship, or recommendation by Smile Agri-Market.</p>
<p>We are not responsible for the content, availability, or privacy practices of external websites.</p>
<h2>11. Availability of the Platform</h2>
<p>We strive to keep the Platform available and functioning effectively.</p>
<p>However, we do not guarantee uninterrupted access.</p>
<p>The Platform may be unavailable due to:</p>
<ul><li>Scheduled maintenance.</li><li>Technical failures.</li><li>Internet disruptions.</li><li>Cybersecurity incidents.</li><li>Power outages.</li><li>Government actions.</li><li>Events beyond our reasonable control.</li></ul>
<h2>12. Limitation of Warranties</h2>
<p>To the fullest extent permitted by applicable law, the Platform and its content are provided on an <strong>"as is"</strong> and <strong>"as available"</strong> basis.</p>
<p>Smile Agri-Market disclaims all express, implied, and statutory warranties, including warranties of:</p>
<ul><li>Merchantability.</li><li>Fitness for a particular purpose.</li><li>Non-infringement.</li><li>Accuracy.</li><li>Availability.</li><li>Reliability.</li></ul>
<p>We do not warrant that the Platform will be free from errors, viruses, or interruptions.</p>
<h2>13. Limitation of Liability</h2>
<p>To the fullest extent permitted by law, Smile Agri-Market Technologies Ltd, its directors, officers, employees, affiliates, agents, and partners shall not be liable for any indirect, incidental, consequential, punitive, or special damages, including loss of profits, business interruption, loss of goodwill, or loss of data arising from:</p>
<ul><li>Use of the Platform.</li><li>Inability to use the Platform.</li><li>Transactions between buyers and sellers.</li><li>Product defects or quality issues attributable to sellers.</li><li>Delivery delays or failures by third-party logistics providers.</li><li>Reliance on information provided through the Platform.</li><li>AI-generated content.</li><li>Third-party services.</li></ul>
<p>Nothing in this Disclaimer excludes or limits liability that cannot lawfully be excluded under applicable law.</p>
<h2>14. Regulatory Compliance</h2>
<p>Users are responsible for ensuring that their activities comply with all applicable laws and regulations, including those relating to:</p>
<ul><li>Agriculture.</li><li>Food safety.</li><li>Consumer protection.</li><li>Product labeling.</li><li>Taxation.</li><li>Import and export controls.</li><li>Environmental protection.</li></ul>
<p>Smile Agri-Market does not guarantee that any particular product or transaction complies with the laws of every jurisdiction.</p>
<h2>15. User Responsibility</h2>
<p>Users are responsible for:</p>
<ul><li>Conducting their own due diligence.</li><li>Reviewing product information carefully.</li><li>Verifying seller credentials where appropriate.</li><li>Using products safely and in accordance with applicable instructions.</li><li>Seeking professional advice where needed.</li></ul>
<h2>16. Changes to This Disclaimer</h2>
<p>We may update this Disclaimer from time to time.</p>
<p>Material changes will be posted on the Platform with an updated Effective Date.</p>
<p>Your continued use of the Platform after changes become effective constitutes acceptance of the revised Disclaimer.</p>
<h2>17. Governing Law</h2>
<p>This Disclaimer is governed by the laws of the Federal Republic of Nigeria.</p>
<p>Nothing in this Disclaimer limits any mandatory rights available to consumers under applicable law.</p>
<h2>18. Contact Us</h2>
<p>If you have questions about this Disclaimer, please contact:</p>
<p><strong>Smile Agri-Market Technologies Ltd</strong></p>
<p>Website: <a href="https://smileagrimarket.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><strong>https://smileagrimarket.com</strong></a></p>
<p>Email: <a href="mailto:legal@smileagrimarket.com"><strong>legal@smileagrimarket.com</strong></a></p>
